OL,3,GNEWSACatholic Church to halve number of
OL,4,AGlasgow parishes as priest numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Catholic Church is to halve the
OL,7,Fnumber of parishes it has in Glasgow
OL,8,Fand Dunbartonshire as part of a major
OL,9,Frestructuring that will see 24 churches
OL,10,Fclose.
OL,12,FArchbishop William Nolan said the move
OL,13,Fwas forced by "too many parishes but
OL,14,Ftoo few people" in a letter to
OL,15,Fcongregations, but admitted the amount
OL,16,Fof closures would be a "painful
OL,17,Fexperience" for many.
OL,19,FHe added that the number of active
OL,20,Fpriests in the the archdiocese had
OL,21,Ffallen by a third within the last five
OL,22,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
