OL,3,GNEWSACatholic Church to halve number of
OL,4,AGlasgow parishes as priest numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA church spokesperson told BBC
OL,7,FScotland's Drivetime programme that the
OL,8,Fnumber of active priests in Glasgow
OL,9,Fcould fall to as few as eight within
OL,10,Fthe next 20 years.
